sequenceDiagram
  actor S as Student
  participant C as Client
  participant E as Experiment Service
  participant SIM as Simulation Component
  participant G as Gamification Engine
  participant DB as Database
  participant R as Cache

  S->>C: complete final step
  C->>E: POST /sessions/{id}/steps
  E->>SIM: validate action against step rule
  SIM-->>E: outcome + observation
  E->>DB: persist step state
  C->>E: POST /sessions/{id}/complete
  E->>DB: write Result (score, dimension scores)
  E->>G: emit completion event
  G->>DB: read Progress + Badge criteria
  G->>DB: award points, update level
  G->>DB: insert Achievement (if criteria met)
  G->>R: update leaderboard
  G-->>E: rewards summary
  E-->>C: result + rewards
  C-->>S: show result, badge, points
